// both over the SAME signing input). The countersignature cannot appear here
// because it does not exist until the server has seen this message. Together
// the two close both fraud directions: Omium cannot mint history the device
// never signed, and a device cannot claim Omium accepted what it never
// countersigned. `ck_m1_receipts_origin` makes that an equivalence in the
// database, so a server act cannot dress up as device-attested.
